{"seq":3,"slug":"ph-hn-launch-playbook","title":"Product Hunt 与 Hacker News 启动","stage":"DONE","category":"indie-app-shipping","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# Product Hunt 与 Hacker News 启动 简介\n\nProduct Hunt 和 Hacker News 是独立开发者最常用的两个发布渠道，用好它们能在一天内集中触达一批早期采用者与技术受众。本 hub 面向要在这两个平台发布产品的独立开发者，从 Product Hunt 机制（基础、发布准备、发布当天）讲起，覆盖 Hacker News（Show HN 什么有效、标题与评论、避免被 flag 与反噬）、发布素材（标语、演示视觉、面向发布的落地页），以及预期与跟进（峰值 vs 持续、找对受众、发布后跟进）。贯穿全篇的诚实主线是：这两个渠道都尊重真实、反营销，靠真诚的呈现和可动员的真实受众取胜；它们带来的是一次性流量峰值而非持续增长，价值在于把峰值流量沉淀为资产、启动持续引擎——而发布的真正成败，取决于受众是否契合，以及发布之后踏实的跟进。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"product-hunt","title":"Product Hunt","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/product-hunt","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ph-fundamentals","title":"Product Hunt 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/product-hunt/ph-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ph-launch-preparation","title":"Product Hunt 发布准备","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/product-hunt/ph-launch-preparation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ph-launch-day","title":"Product Hunt 发布当天","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/product-hunt/ph-launch-day"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"hacker-news","title":"Hacker News","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/hacker-news","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"show-hn-what-works","title":"Show HN：什么有效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/hacker-news/show-hn-what-works"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hn-titles-and-comments","title":"HN 标题与评论参与","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/hacker-news/hn-titles-and-comments"},{"seq":3,"slug":"avoiding-flag-and-backlash","title":